{"posts":[{"id":"quasimodo_p7_151","t":"Bushido wrote: Hello!\n\nPlease free to comment/ask/judge.\n\nI have changed my former nickname ssirovnik to Bushido for personal reasons -just for info.\n\nHi Bushido, Nice collection here but how will you trade say example 1?Where entry,SL,TP?","a":"Lanceo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#151","p":7,"im":["e04f791faca77fb3b62748078a8189540361dfde","db7a24f0a95e518a843fc83d470edb6f76a768d0","183fcc681258dff36adcb925ddbbaa7719d9ab4e","7b6b0bcd35e55b173dfc18ccda7b0674b4608c91","8379ef8acb652237297e7a96db4d405b236216ee","d26c961a25f9916b892fec2557d78ee168df1d69","b7badebf739bcb023c1a6f4457162f4c41f7a3be","7cfd7f7965cbe44a517150f73656c1a108c2c449"],"fa":"Bushido نوشت: سلام!\n\nلطفاً راحت نظر بدهید، بپرسید یا قضاوت کنید.\n\nنام مستعار قبلی‌ام ssirovnik را به دلایل شخصی به Bushido تغییر داده‌ام — فقط برای اطلاع.\n\nسلام Bushido، مجموعه خوبی اینجا داری، ولی مثلاً مثال 1 را چطور معامله می‌کنی؟ ورود، SL، TP کجا؟","ib":{"e04f791faca77fb3b62748078a8189540361dfde":3,"db7a24f0a95e518a843fc83d470edb6f76a768d0":3,"183fcc681258dff36adcb925ddbbaa7719d9ab4e":3,"7b6b0bcd35e55b173dfc18ccda7b0674b4608c91":3,"8379ef8acb652237297e7a96db4d405b236216ee":3,"d26c961a25f9916b892fec2557d78ee168df1d69":3,"b7badebf739bcb023c1a6f4457162f4c41f7a3be":3,"7cfd7f7965cbe44a517150f73656c1a108c2c449":3},"m":151},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_152","t":"Hello!\n\nThanks for the fast reply - see it more clearly now - concerning the approach.\n\nOut charts differ also in spikes. The daily TF is clear to me - yeah - strong demand on left created before.\n\nAlso some CP's arround this.","a":"Bushido","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#152","p":7,"im":["1bfca727dc064f014fddcb38e39488f3f353b348"],"fa":"سلام!\n\nممنون از پاسخ سریع — حالا با توجه به این رویکرد، واضح‌تر می‌بینمش.\n\nنمودارهای ما در اسپایک‌ها هم تفاوت دارند. تایم‌فریم روزانه برایم واضح است — بله — تقاضای قوی در سمت چپ که قبلاً شکل گرفته.\n\nچند CP هم دور این هستند.","ib":{"1bfca727dc064f014fddcb38e39488f3f353b348":4},"m":152},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_153","t":"Hello Lanceo!\n\nSee attachment.","a":"Bushido","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#153","p":7,"im":["715e386d050f5e720333db893a226ed9cbdb843d"],"fa":"سلام Lanceo!\n\nپیوست را ببین.","ib":{"715e386d050f5e720333db893a226ed9cbdb843d":2},"m":153},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_154","t":"Bushido wrote: Hello Lanceo!\n\nSee attachment.\n\nThank you, It is look I chosen easiest ones:)).I am not too much pattern man but I like your work here. All the best.","a":"Lanceo","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#154","p":7,"im":["715e386d050f5e720333db893a226ed9cbdb843d"],"fa":"Bushido نوشت: سلام Lanceo!\n\nپیوست را ببین.\n\nممنون، ظاهراً من ساده‌ترین‌ها را انتخاب کرده‌ام:)). من زیاد آدم الگوها نیستم ولی کارت را اینجا دوست دارم. همه‌چیز خوب.","ib":{"715e386d050f5e720333db893a226ed9cbdb843d":2},"m":154},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_155","t":"Trying to do thee HW's at my best - slowly i'm getting this S/D concept into the blood.","a":"Bushido","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#155","p":7,"im":[],"fa":"دارم تلاشم را می‌کنم تمرین‌ها را در بهترین شکل انجام دهم — آرام‌آرام این مفهوم S/D دارد به خونم می‌رود.","m":155},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_156","t":"","a":"benhur","d":"","r":"Master Trader","n":"#156","p":7,"im":["7b27145e0e4439a005c2b7c111b0a17b90bc9812"],"ib":{"7b27145e0e4439a005c2b7c111b0a17b90bc9812":0},"m":156},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_157","t":"Once again, I've spent some screen time and lo and behold, on the daily charts are quite a few, bouncing price between S/D. From far right, in the red, shows what appears to be a failed quasimodo. However, after the LL, price compressed back up to the daily S area, drawn in with white paint, before it shot back down to demand. To the right of that, drawn in on both green and blue are two others, firstly at demand which pushed price back to supply, and the opposite which shoved it back down. To the extreme right, in yellow appears what might be another quasimodo forming, time will tell.\n\nAt this point, its no surprise that with more and more homework being done, its surely getting easier to spot them.\n\nAnd here is the chart BTW......\n\nComments are quite welcome.","a":"Springger","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#157","p":7,"im":["f181903bc1fcccc134ed2915e9c84aa08345be1f"],"fa":"یک بار دیگر، مدتی پشت صفحه گذراندم و ببین، در نمودارهای روزانه کم نیستند، که قیمت را بین S/D بالا و پایین می‌برند. از سمت راست دور، در قسمت قرمز، چیزی دیده می‌شود که ظاهراً یک Quasimodo ناکام است. اما بعد از LL، قیمت فشرده شد و به ناحیه S روزانه که با رنگ سفید رسم شده برگشت، قبل از اینکه دوباره به سمت تقاضا سقوط کند. سمت راست آن، دو مورد دیگر روی سبز و آبی رسم شده‌اند؛ اولی در تقاضا که قیمت را به عرضه برگرداند، و دومی برعکس که آن را به پایین هُل داد. در انتهای راست، به رنگ زرد چیزی دیده می‌شود که ممکن است یک Quasimodo دیگر باشد که در حال شکل‌گیری است؛ زمان می‌گوید.\n\nدر این مرحله تعجبی ندارد که هرچه تمرین بیشتری انجام شود، پیدا کردنشان قطعاً راحت‌تر می‌شود.\n\nراستی نمودار هم این است…\n\nکامنت‌ها را با آغوش باز می‌پذیرم.","ib":{"f181903bc1fcccc134ed2915e9c84aa08345be1f":3},"m":157},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_158","t":"Hi all\n\nHere I'll post my Quasimodo homework. Feel free to comment please.\n\nRegards, Ashkan","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#158","p":7,"im":[],"fa":"سلام به همه\n\nاینجا تمرین Quasimodo خودم را می‌گذارم. لطفاً راحت کامنت بگذارید.\n\nبا احترام، Ashkan","m":158},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_159","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#159","p":7,"im":["4145f3ed2e53f0205c6680c8685151f0f3c297c0"],"ib":{"4145f3ed2e53f0205c6680c8685151f0f3c297c0":0},"m":159},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_160","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#160","p":7,"im":["f756c2d87b5433ca1319636f32bd4df1bce6b2c8"],"ib":{"f756c2d87b5433ca1319636f32bd4df1bce6b2c8":0},"m":160},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_161","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#161","p":7,"im":["fd93e796e73bdcc56032b8fa6e5137e43db21694"],"ib":{"fd93e796e73bdcc56032b8fa6e5137e43db21694":0},"m":161},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_162","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#162","p":7,"im":["f5adc741da345c8f3d8a6ab38741ab329e224df4"],"ib":{"f5adc741da345c8f3d8a6ab38741ab329e224df4":0},"m":162},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_163","t":"For my part, looks good, keep it up. However, keep in mind that the Supply and Demand areas on HTF are more significant than on these LTF.\n\nKeep in mind that we are both in school, so i might also be wrong.\n\nBest Regards, spring","a":"Springger","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#163","p":7,"im":[],"fa":"از طرف من، خوب به نظر می‌رسد، ادامه بده. اما یادت باشد که ناحیه‌های عرضه و تقاضا در تایم‌فریم بالاتر معنادارتر از این تایم‌فریم‌های پایین‌تر هستند.\n\nیادت باشد ما هر دو در حال یادگیری هستیم، پس ممکن است من هم اشتباه کنم.\n\nبا بهترین احترام، spring","m":163},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_164","t":"Hi Spring\n\nThanks for your comment. You're right, S/D on HTFs are more important. I'll try to find Quasimodo near S/D on HTFs.\n\nRegards, Ashkan","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#164","p":7,"im":[],"fa":"سلام Spring\n\nممنون از کامنتت. درست می‌گویی، S/D در تایم‌فریم‌های بالاتر مهم‌تر است. سعی می‌کنم Quasimodo را نزدیک همین S/D‌های تایم‌فریم بالاتر پیدا کنم.\n\nبا احترام، Ashkan","m":164},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_165","t":"Hi,\n\nQuasimodo on EURGBP. Clear demand on H4 chart. Then QM was formed, and priced pushed upwards.\n\nComments are welcomed.\n\nEntry on demand level in H1 chart:","a":"Neopips","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#165","p":7,"im":["f566e26ee3ecc0b1516ee3ddd7945ebdf1cd255d","5f4e328b55f8ff5ce283c6b8c72097fe50173e50"],"fa":"سلام،\n\nQuasimodo روی EURGBP. تقاضای واضح در نمودار H4. بعد QM تشکیل شد و قیمت به بالا هُل داده شد.\n\nکامنت‌ها پذیرفته می‌شوند.\n\nورود روی سطح تقاضا در نمودار H1:","ib":{"f566e26ee3ecc0b1516ee3ddd7945ebdf1cd255d":3,"5f4e328b55f8ff5ce283c6b8c72097fe50173e50":4},"m":165},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_166","t":"Ok I\n\nI traded my first Quasimodo","a":"Nosbigs","d":"","r":"","n":"#166","p":7,"im":["7006b09d6ee24a1a0487d15122770b16e8a9f5a0"],"fa":"خب، من\n\nاولین Quasimodo‌ام را معامله کردم","ib":{"7006b09d6ee24a1a0487d15122770b16e8a9f5a0":1},"m":166},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_167","t":"EURUSD chart:\n\n1) Price form a clean RBD (therefore good supply) 2) Price return to the base of RBD for first time 3) QM entry on lower TF (bit messy though)\n\nH1\n\nEntry on Lower TF M5:","a":"Neopips","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#167","p":7,"im":["bc014b89416ad3aa7db4944838aeaa1d2f45f234","fd855015d6771488a80dd248fedc5aa63f5d0871"],"fa":"نمودار EURUSD:\n\n1) قیمت یک RBD تمیز می‌سازد (و بنابراین عرضه خوب) 2) قیمت برای اولین بار به بیس RBD برمی‌گردد 3) ورود QM در LTF (هرچند کمی شلوغ)\n\nH1\n\nورود در تایم‌فریم پایین‌تر M5:","ib":{"bc014b89416ad3aa7db4944838aeaa1d2f45f234":3,"fd855015d6771488a80dd248fedc5aa63f5d0871":4},"m":167},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_168","t":"First attempt. H1 cable","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","r":"","n":"#168","p":7,"im":["7f194f6acbf6cc07cc515a3e52b27af23b8ab990"],"fa":"اولین تلاش. کابل در H1","ib":{"7f194f6acbf6cc07cc515a3e52b27af23b8ab990":1},"m":168},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_169","t":"This one hasn't happened yet as price hasn't made the high of the first left shoulder high but if it does is it a valid set up? All comments greatly appreciated. Daily euro/oz","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","r":"","n":"#169","p":7,"im":["65d079121f2e43baae7b3910e1561ba58d5dbb71"],"fa":"این یکی هنوز اتفاق نیفتاده، چون قیمت سقفِ شانه چپ اول را نساخته، اما اگر بسازد، ستاپ معتبری است؟ از همه کامنت‌ها خیلی ممنونم. EUR/OZ روزانه","ib":{"65d079121f2e43baae7b3910e1561ba58d5dbb71":1},"m":169},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_170","t":"This makes it a little easier to see.","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","r":"","n":"#170","p":7,"im":["b845d499927a312bf978f7c8577cd3aa8032d0b6"],"fa":"این دیدنش را کمی راحت‌تر می‌کند.","ib":{"b845d499927a312bf978f7c8577cd3aa8032d0b6":1},"m":170},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_171","t":"","a":"Oedipus99","d":"","r":"","n":"#171","p":7,"im":["535ba4a611f6c564f2c766d71671d7e067969849"],"ib":{"535ba4a611f6c564f2c766d71671d7e067969849":0},"m":171},{"id":"quasimodo_p7_172","t":"Posting Quasimodo homework. Comments welcomed.\n\nUSD/CHF H4","a":"AlexC","d":"","r":"Associate Trader